These AC-3 source fixtures contain generated 997 Hz sine tones, not movie audio.
They were created with FFmpeg's AC-3 encoder using the rates, channel layouts,
and bitrates indicated in their filenames and dialogue normalization -27 dB.
Each file contains only its first complete frame. The stereo48_192 fixture has
Dolby Surround mode 2. The surround48_640xbsi fixture additionally sets downmix
mode 2, Lt/Rt center 0.70710678, Lt/Rt surround 0.5, Lo/Ro center 0.59460356,
Lo/Ro surround 0.70710678, Surround EX mode 2, and A/D converter type 1.

The regression hashes in silence_test.go are hashes of silent frames produced
from these metadata settings and matched against the historical encoder.
